Hi,

I will apply for the Linux Foundation as mentoring organization for this 
year's Google Summer of Code again.

For that I have posted the project ideas list for OpenPrinting here

https://wiki.linuxfoundation.org/gsoc/google-summer-code-2017-openprinting-projects

Please have a look at it and edit it, especially adding your project 
ideas and correcting typos and other errors.

To edit, it is enough to have an account on the Linux Foundation web 
site, no membership in a special group is needed.

Aveek Basu from Lexmark is already looking for suitable students.

    Till
